"why_high_value": "New spectroscopic-ellipsometry family on a PECVD SiN passivation (not THz-TDS r20/r21, not hyperspectral r16, not QCM-D r14, not RUS r24, not LPBF r03, not SPR r26, not MW-cavity r26, not NMR T2 r27). First Cauchy-n plus OPD/2n reconstruction that can hide a 180 nm film inside a 118 nm last-good corridor. Companion t2 is operational skip refusal. sim_or_real=simulated.",